OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to consider plans for
OL,4,Adedicated Muslim cemetery
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a dedicated Muslim
OL,7,Fcemetery are to be considered by
OL,8,FMidlothian Council.
OL,10,FThe WAFA foundation charity said it
OL,11,Fhoped the site, between the King's Gate
OL,12,Fand Lothian Bridge at Newbattle, near
OL,13,FDalkeith, will be able to accommodate
OL,14,F2,000 plots over the next 100 years.
OL,16,FIt said the cemetery, which could
OL,17,Fhandle up to 50 burials a year, will
OL,18,Fallow families to be buried together
OL,19,Fand cope with demand for space
OL,20,Faccording to Islamic funeral tradition.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
