OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to consider plans for
OL,4,Adedicated Muslim cemetery
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposals also involve the
OL,7,Fconstruction of two funeral buildings
OL,8,Fto oversee burials and new car parking
OL,9,Ffacilities.
